  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Troca_ConcessaoSaneamento
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Concess\xE3o de servi\xE7o p\xFAblico"
  _titleEn: Public service concession
  _category: 2
  _unlockTrigger: 13
  _summary: "Na concess\xE3o, o poder p\xFAblico entrega a opera\xE7\xE3o de um servi\xE7o
    a uma empresa por um prazo longo. A empresa investe e cobra tarifa; a prefeitura
    ou o estado fiscaliza e cobra as metas do contrato."
  _summaryEn: In a concession, the government hands the running of a service to a
    company for a long term. The company invests and charges fees; the city or state
    oversees it and enforces the contract's targets.
  _realWorld: "Em 2021, a \xE1gua e o esgoto de 35 munic\xEDpios atendidos pela Cedae,
    no Rio de Janeiro, foram leiloados em quatro blocos, com contratos de 35 anos.
    Os blocos 1, 2 e 4 renderam cerca de R$ 22,7 bilh\xF5es em outorga."
  _realWorldEn: In 2021, water and sewage in 35 municipalities served by Cedae, in
    Rio de Janeiro, were auctioned in four blocks under 35-year contracts. Blocks
    1, 2 and 4 raised about R$ 22.7 billion in concession fees.
  _tradeOffs: "Contrato de d\xE9cadas \xE9 dif\xEDcil de rever: se a tarifa sobe
    ou a meta n\xE3o sai, a cidade depende da fiscaliza\xE7\xE3o e da Justi\xE7a."
  _tradeOffsEn: 'A decades-long contract is hard to revisit: if fees rise or targets
    slip, the city depends on oversight and the courts.'
  _sources:
  - Label: "Reuters via Not\xEDcias Agr\xEDcolas, leil\xE3o da Cedae (2021)"
    Url: https://www.noticiasagricolas.com.br/noticias/politica-economia/286784-aegea-e-igua-vencem-disputa-por-ativos-da-cedae-leilao-movimenta-r227-bi.amp.html
  - Label: Lei 14.026/2020, Marco Legal do Saneamento
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2019-2022/2020/lei/l14026.htm
